{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a free demo version of <strong>God Syndrome</strong>, offering a complete playable episode from the full game. Dive into one of the early chapters, experience the atmosphere, and get a taste of the choices, challenges, and psychological tension that await in the full story.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Atmospheric Psychological Horror Roguelike</strong>. The game combines elements of a visual novel and a quest, offering a dynamic, immersive story with visually striking scenes. Enjoy a storyline that comes alive before your eyes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Freedom to Explore</strong>. Move wherever you want, discover new locations, and immerse yourself in the environment. You\u2019re not just an observer but an active participant in this story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Exploration of Locations</strong>. Search for important items that will unlock new possibilities or protect you when you need it most.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Puzzle Solving</strong>. Solve puzzles to obtain unique items or save the most valuable thing you have \u2014 your life. Sometimes, a riddle\u2019s solution is the only way to survive.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unpredictability</strong>. Be prepared for unexpected events that can completely change the rules of the game. Other people, traps, and puzzles are far from the greatest threats. There is something much more terrifying lurking in the darkness of this world\u2026</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3666800?t=1744740346","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666800/ca3ee63d47cf0dcd3215fc1f2142d0d601f125cd/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744740346","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/