 rules of the game. Other people, traps, and puzzles are far from the greatest threats. There is something much more terrifying lurking in the darkness of this world\u2026</p></li></ul>","developers":["ArtHeart Studio"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3338050","name":"God Syndrome"},"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666800/80706e752a87892cb065875d586b488025e23900/header.jpg?t=1744740346","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"God Syndrome Demo","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7/8/10/11 (64bit ver)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 (Sandy Bridge) or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated graphics supporting OpenGL 2.0 or better<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX compatible</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["ArtHeart Studio"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Linguagem impr\u00f3pria\nViol\u00eancia\nMedo","rating":"14","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"14","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Horror\nDerbe Sprache","rating":"16","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"16","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"Coming soon"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666800/51062687e3752c4ac1c572c55c330fd8fef16cd5/ss_51062687e3752c4ac1c572c55c330fd8fef16cd5.1920x1080.jpg?t=1744740346","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666800/51062687e3752c4ac1c572c55c330fd8fef16cd5/ss_51062687e3752c4ac1c